249
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,820
Get outta the way! I almost hit your equipment!

250
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,860
Looks good, right? What do you think?

251
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:48,540
I'll work hard at it.

252
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,870
Shawn, are you trying to annoy me?

253
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,340
Can't you see I'm doing my maintenance?

254
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,300
Go away, shoo.

255
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:59,070
My Grandpa goes to bed early.

256
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,540
So don't be calling too late.

257
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:06,780
I'm definitely the strongest one on this Team.

258
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:11,100
I'm way better than that chubby kid, Chuck, for sure.

259
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:15,420
The one getting cut is Mickey, for sure.

260
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,380
Today we're holding the Full-Team Skill Competition.

261
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,270
The Competition will be in two Parts.

262
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:32,220
Part 1 is a contest of basic tricks.

263
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:35,580
The whole Team must complete all 30 Basic Tricks.

264
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,500
Anyone who makes a mistake is out.

265
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:39,390
If we still don't have a clear result after that,

266
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,860
we'll move on to part 2 of the Competition.

267
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:42,780
The Coach will randomly select a trick,

268
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,700
and we'll have a freestyle trick contest.

269
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,190
The Player with the worst performance is out.

270
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:49,500
Coach.

271
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,820
Alright, everyone.

272
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:55,740
This Competition

273
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,660
is meant to determine the Jianghai Team's

274
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,580
6 Official Tournament Members.

275
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:02,460
But it's also a major Training
Exercise for the entire Team.

276
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,860
Everyone is being judged equally.

277
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:09,150
I want you all to be careful and cautious,

278
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:11,000
but to compete at your highest level.

279
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,910
Alright, the Competition starts now.

280
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,990
First up is Part 1:

281
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:17,300
the Basic Tricks Contest.

282
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:18,300
Everyone get ready.

283
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,000
Coach!

284
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,420
Any questions?

285
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:25,370
So whoever messes up first is out?

286
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,540
That's right.

287
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,380
Get ready.

288
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,820
Coach!

289
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,700
Now what?

290
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:35,580
Does the person who messes up get a second chance?

291
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:37,980
Of course not.

292
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,900
Any more questions?

293
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,000
No more.

294
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,710
Ok, Get ready.

295
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,700
Coach!

296
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:46,620
Chuck, what's your deal?

297
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:47,580
I gotta use the bathroom.

298
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,540
Why isn't Chuck back yet?

299
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:14,460
You think he's got the runs?

300
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:17,340
We should go check on him.

301
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,260
I already looked. He's not in the bathroom.

302
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:20,700
Did you check the other bathrooms?

303
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:24,060
There's over 20 bathrooms in this whole school.

304
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:26,460
Who knows which one he's hiding in?

305
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:34,620
Alright.

306
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,320
We're not waiting any longer. Let's begin.

307
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:38,460
Line up!

308
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,580
Alright, all pass unanimously.

